WEBVTT

00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:08.340
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.043 --> 00:00:11.912
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:13.971
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:18.945
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:23.357
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:25.484
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:30.287
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:34.769
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.769 --> 00:00:37.397
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.672 --> 00:00:41.267
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:47.374
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:49.884
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:53.081
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.922 --> 00:00:57.091
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.091 --> 00:01:01.152
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:06.025
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.802 --> 00:01:09.292
Let's go!

00:01:12.606 --> 00:01:16.007
WELL-HANDLED SOLUTIONS

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:22.071
Listen to me, all of you!

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:26.349
Now that Her Highness is held by
the United Planets Space Force...

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.615
...we haven't a moment to lose!

00:01:28.889 --> 00:01:31.016
Now is the time for us
to unite our power...

00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:36.394
...and recover our empress
from the accursed UPSF!

00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:39.254
Wait!

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:44.037
We generals only move on
Her Highness' orders!

00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:47.939
As prime minister, you have
no authority to give orders!

00:01:48.676 --> 00:01:51.975
What are you saying.
With Her Highness gone...

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:55.538
...I hold complete
authority over the Empire.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.218
No, we of the
Raalgon Imperial Forces...

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.685
...will only lay down our
lives for Her Highness!

00:02:06.894 --> 00:02:09.192
If Her Highness
doesn't return soon...

00:02:09.463 --> 00:02:12.125
...it could end up ripping
our empire in half!

00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:13.859
Or else...

00:02:17.071 --> 00:02:20.199
Tylor, keep Her Highness safe!

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:23.307
CHEERS!

00:02:30.751 --> 00:02:32.309
All right! Good job!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.447
Wow, this is great, you all
throwing this party for me.

00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:37.091
Glad You're Well, Captain!

00:02:37.091 --> 00:02:38.859
Glad You're Well, Captain!
What're you talkin' about?

00:02:38.859 --> 00:02:42.563
Glad You're Well, Captain!
If it weren't for you,
we'd all be goners by now!

00:02:42.563 --> 00:02:42.930
Glad You're Well, Captain!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.522
Glad You're Well, Captain!
C'mon, have some more!

00:02:44.799 --> 00:02:47.029
The captain performs
when he needs to.

00:02:48.002 --> 00:02:50.137
The captain's the star
of the show tonight!

00:02:50.137 --> 00:02:51.968
So stay with us till
the party's over!

00:02:52.473 --> 00:02:53.963
Mr. Tylor's so wonderful!

00:02:54.175 --> 00:02:58.669
Yeah! He'd sacrifice
himself to save his crew!

00:02:58.946 --> 00:03:03.883
It's not just that. He's an
exceptionally kind man, too.

00:03:04.185 --> 00:03:06.449
He can stare death in the
face and never lose his cool.

00:03:06.654 --> 00:03:08.383
I wonder how his brain works?

00:03:08.856 --> 00:03:11.290
Tylor's a real enigma.

00:03:13.527 --> 00:03:14.619
No more...

00:03:14.895 --> 00:03:20.060
Captain, we brought you something
great to celebrate your recovery.

00:03:20.401 --> 00:03:21.129
Something great?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.528
Check it out.

00:03:25.172 --> 00:03:26.503
What's? That...

00:03:28.876 --> 00:03:30.571
Isn't that a?!

00:03:31.312 --> 00:03:33.041
Keep your voice down!

00:03:34.215 --> 00:03:39.520
I'd like to say it's a present,
but this is our greatest treasure!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.353
So, once you watch it,
we want it back, okay?

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:46.485
Now, if Yuriko should find
it and confiscate it...

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.620
Or if you should
accidentally erase it, then...

00:03:50.498 --> 00:03:51.658
Then what?

00:03:55.202 --> 00:03:57.568
Let's just say that saying
"I'm sorry" won't save you.

00:03:57.638 --> 00:04:04.544
Roger. Glad to see my crew
cares so much about me.

00:04:04.845 --> 00:04:08.713
Leave him alone, you people!
Paco-Paco is my beloved pet!

00:04:11.018 --> 00:04:12.883
So treat him well!

00:04:15.589 --> 00:04:17.921
Paco-Paco?! That's great!

00:04:18.592 --> 00:04:20.890
How rude! And just
what is so amusing?!

00:04:21.762 --> 00:04:23.252
Azalyn, calm down.

00:04:23.564 --> 00:04:26.362
This is just how we greet
each other on the Soyokaze.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.567
A greeting?

00:04:27.735 --> 00:04:33.696
Yeah. Oh, Azalyn, are we going
to do what Mr. Yamamoto said?

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:37.202
You know, that regulation about
the treatment of prisoners.

00:04:37.545 --> 00:04:40.070
The one that says we
have to treat you well.

00:04:41.615 --> 00:04:46.143
UPSF regulations, article 13,
paragraph 7.

00:04:46.387 --> 00:04:48.821
The treatment
of prisoners of war.

00:04:48.923 --> 00:04:50.254
That's the one!

00:04:50.558 --> 00:04:53.891
Sir, it's my opinion that,
for her sake...

00:04:53.961 --> 00:04:57.488
...we treat her as the
regs say we should. So?

00:04:58.299 --> 00:04:59.561
It's your call, Azalyn.

00:05:01.635 --> 00:05:02.932
Well...

00:05:09.977 --> 00:05:12.002
Paco-Paco, I shall stay here.

00:05:12.179 --> 00:05:12.873
Really?

00:05:13.147 --> 00:05:13.704
Yes.

00:05:13.914 --> 00:05:15.882
I don't know how to put it,
but there's something good...

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.941
...on this vessel which is
missing from the Melva.

00:05:19.153 --> 00:05:20.677
Pretty sharp, Highness.

00:05:20.754 --> 00:05:23.587
It didn't take you long to spot
what's good about this ship.

00:05:23.924 --> 00:05:26.060
Some people who've been here
a long time still don't see it.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.687
Right, Mr. Yamamoto?

00:05:28.329 --> 00:05:31.264
Although, truthfully, even
Mr. Yamamoto understands now.

00:05:31.498 --> 00:05:34.626
Come on! Come on!
Let's keep this going!

00:05:50.351 --> 00:05:51.375
Pardon me!

00:05:52.386 --> 00:05:56.948
Your Highness, to prevent
any incidents, we will be...

00:06:01.996 --> 00:06:05.796
We will be locking the door!

00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:07.898
Good night and sleep well!

00:06:11.605 --> 00:06:13.505
So? How'd it go?

00:06:13.707 --> 00:06:15.231
Check, complete!

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:19.042
Damn it, what are
you staring at?!

00:06:24.518 --> 00:06:27.749
It was a fun party and I
know how they all feel...

00:06:27.988 --> 00:06:30.548
...but I wish they never
gave me this tape.

00:06:37.998 --> 00:06:41.764
Paco-Paco is so late. He must
be fooling around somewhere.

00:07:20.274 --> 00:07:21.673
What's he doing?

00:07:22.509 --> 00:07:25.808
No matter. I'll get back at him
for being late by scaring him!

00:07:28.749 --> 00:07:29.716
For Viewers 18 and Over Only!

00:07:46.366 --> 00:07:48.266
Oh, no! It's erasing!

00:07:48.335 --> 00:07:50.064
Come on! Please!

00:07:50.137 --> 00:07:54.039
Oh, man, if I don't stop it,
they'll kill me!

00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:55.573
Excuse us!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.802
Captain, if you were in,
why didn't you answer?

00:08:00.114 --> 00:08:03.481
Huh? You're sweating.
Is something wrong?

00:08:03.817 --> 00:08:06.342
Uh... Oh, no!
It's nothing, really!

00:08:09.823 --> 00:08:11.552
Anyway, what can I do for you?

00:08:14.495 --> 00:08:15.723
Mr. Tylor...

00:08:15.829 --> 00:08:18.389
Will you listen to
what we have to say?

00:08:19.133 --> 00:08:19.861
To say?

00:08:19.967 --> 00:08:20.558
Right!

00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:22.028
So tell me.

00:08:22.402 --> 00:08:23.596
Emi, come on!

00:08:23.837 --> 00:08:25.896
No, you go first, Sis.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:28.199
No, you go first.

00:08:28.475 --> 00:08:29.737
I'm too shy!

00:08:30.511 --> 00:08:31.773
I can't say it!

00:08:32.146 --> 00:08:33.636
Sis, come on!

00:08:34.181 --> 00:08:35.614
Come on, Emi!

00:08:36.183 --> 00:08:37.411
I can't!

00:08:38.118 --> 00:08:39.551
Emi, hurry up!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:40.816
I can't!

00:08:40.888 --> 00:08:42.879
What are you trying to say?

00:08:45.392 --> 00:08:49.886
Mr. Tylor, you're always
ready to risk your life for us.

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.855
And you're also so thoughtful.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.836
Too bad everyone doesn't
seem to realize that.

00:08:55.836 --> 00:08:57.929
So, we made up our minds!

00:08:58.205 --> 00:09:01.368
Please...
Let us be your lovers!

00:09:01.642 --> 00:09:02.870
Wha- What?!

00:09:04.211 --> 00:09:07.203
Oh, I have to find some
way to stop this!

00:09:07.481 --> 00:09:10.006
Telling them "I'm sorry"
isn't going to work!

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.484
Y- You mean we should
keep our relationship...

00:09:15.556 --> 00:09:17.786
...the way it is, Mr. Tylor?

00:09:19.226 --> 00:09:23.629
If you feel you should apologize,
just forget about what we just said.

00:09:25.666 --> 00:09:28.100
Umm...
That's not what I meant...

00:09:31.572 --> 00:09:35.599
I see... Paco-Paco isn't
interested in younger women.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.610
Then I shall have to use
more mature wiles on him.

00:09:57.798 --> 00:09:58.730
Lieutenant Yamamoto.

00:09:59.366 --> 00:10:01.891
Commander Star.
I thought you'd be here.

00:10:02.436 --> 00:10:05.633
Yeah, I figured I'd straighten
up before going to bed.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.634
And you, Lieutenant Yamamoto?

00:10:08.008 --> 00:10:12.877
Yes, well... I was raised in
a strict military home...

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:16.047
...so I canâ€™t just
ignore this mess!

00:10:18.619 --> 00:10:21.179
I've also tried to live
my life like a soldier...

00:10:23.891 --> 00:10:24.789
Lieutenant Yamamoto.

00:10:25.192 --> 00:10:25.886
Yes?

00:10:26.293 --> 00:10:31.026
Can you remember the things you
thought about when you were 16?

00:10:32.399 --> 00:10:34.867
When I was 16?

00:10:51.685 --> 00:10:54.085
So, what did you want to
talk about, Lieutenant Kim?

00:10:57.190 --> 00:11:00.523
Look, Tylor, you'd like
to go out with me, right?

00:11:01.261 --> 00:11:02.421
Sure. So?

00:11:02.729 --> 00:11:06.927
I've never called you
captain, you know.

00:11:07.334 --> 00:11:11.668
To be honest, I didn't think
much of you when we first met.

00:11:11.772 --> 00:11:13.603
Oh, I see...

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.799
But I feel differently now.
How can I put it?

00:11:17.911 --> 00:11:23.713
I was always trying so hard to be
a good soldier AND a real woman.

00:11:24.351 --> 00:11:26.520
But when I saw how
carefree you were...

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:29.580
...I realized I was knocking
myself out for nothing.

00:11:29.656 --> 00:11:30.991
No kidding...

00:11:30.991 --> 00:11:33.926
Thanks to you, I feel so
much better about my life.

00:11:33.994 --> 00:11:35.188
And that's when
I thought of it.

00:11:35.696 --> 00:11:39.097
That I'd want to live with a man
like you for the rest of my life.

00:11:40.667 --> 00:11:42.760
So, you see, Tylor...

00:11:48.709 --> 00:11:49.505
Tylor?

00:11:54.681 --> 00:11:56.410
You really are an idiot!

00:11:56.717 --> 00:11:58.844
Oh, I totally
agree with you...

00:11:59.186 --> 00:12:00.312
I'm going back to my room!

00:12:01.355 --> 00:12:03.448
Feel free to visit if
you want to talk again.

00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:09.562
As if! I'll never try to have
a serious talk with you again!

00:12:12.366 --> 00:12:14.834
Guess I said something
wrong to her.

00:12:15.635 --> 00:12:17.933
Wonder what she wanted
to talk to me about?

00:12:18.739 --> 00:12:20.969
Damn! This is no time to
be wondering about that!

00:12:21.942 --> 00:12:24.001
I see... Paco-Paco
doesn't deal well...

00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:26.102
...with extremely
forward people, either.

00:12:26.413 --> 00:12:29.746
I'm learning so much by
watching him like this!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.514
What we should
do with the empress?

00:12:32.753 --> 00:12:36.917
Yes. I wanted to ask
you about what you think...

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:39.081
...we should do with her,
Lieutenant.

00:12:39.359 --> 00:12:40.883
It's obvious!

00:12:41.094 --> 00:12:45.895
We should turn her over to HQ
and let them decide what to do.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.901
The brass will probably use her
as a trump card in the war.

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:52.833
Which means our forces will win!

00:12:53.273 --> 00:12:57.334
As the ones who captured her,
we'll be proclaimed heroes...

00:12:57.411 --> 00:13:00.744
...and go down in history as the
ones who led the way to victory!

00:13:05.118 --> 00:13:08.781
Umm... Well, I think that's
the right answer to give.

00:13:09.322 --> 00:13:13.656
Of course you're right.
And as a UPSF officer...

00:13:13.727 --> 00:13:15.718
...I agree that it's the
correct answer to give.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:17.324
But...

00:13:18.131 --> 00:13:18.893
But?

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.466
The empress is just a young girl.

00:13:23.136 --> 00:13:26.071
To use a child like
that as tool in a war...

00:13:26.239 --> 00:13:27.536
Is that right?

00:13:28.775 --> 00:13:29.605
That's!

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:35.205
But she's the empress
of an enemy state!

00:13:35.682 --> 00:13:39.140
She's also a very innocent
16-year-old girl.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.217
I know it's a love
that can lead nowhere!

00:13:45.792 --> 00:13:49.387
But I don't know how to respond
to feelings that burn like this!

00:13:49.529 --> 00:13:51.429
Maybe you just had a
little too much to drink.

00:13:51.631 --> 00:13:54.623
Harumi, I think you
should calm down.

00:13:54.701 --> 00:13:56.225
I can't calm down!

00:13:56.837 --> 00:13:58.930
I've never had feelings
like this before.

00:13:59.573 --> 00:14:03.743
What would a human woman do?
What should I do?!

00:14:03.743 --> 00:14:07.110
Please, Captain Tylor, tell me!

00:14:08.348 --> 00:14:12.614
How do I know for sure it's love?!
How do I be a real human woman?!

00:14:13.153 --> 00:14:14.814
Hold on, please, Harumi!

00:14:15.021 --> 00:14:16.921
We don't have time for this!

00:14:17.991 --> 00:14:19.720
We don't have time for this?

00:14:20.861 --> 00:14:22.692
That's right! You're right!

00:14:23.163 --> 00:14:24.528
We don't have time for this!

00:14:26.466 --> 00:14:29.594
You're right, Captain.
We're fighting a war.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:33.772
Now isn't the time to
be thinking of such things!

00:14:34.774 --> 00:14:37.208
Good night, Captain!
Excuse me.

00:14:37.744 --> 00:14:38.472
Right...

00:14:44.885 --> 00:14:48.446
Paco-Paco, even directly stating
love to you doesn't work, either.

00:14:48.755 --> 00:14:52.282
And he's so popular with
all the women on board!

00:14:53.493 --> 00:14:58.396
But hiding here let me see
how Paco-Paco really feels!

00:14:58.965 --> 00:15:02.492
All I must do now is take
courage and confess my love!

00:15:08.508 --> 00:15:10.476
Of course!
The remote control!

00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:14.645
I'll be able to stop
it with the remote!

00:15:14.915 --> 00:15:19.545
Oh, the remote... The remote...
Where's the remote?!

00:15:21.254 --> 00:15:22.278
There it is!

00:15:27.427 --> 00:15:28.485
AZALYN?!

00:15:29.896 --> 00:15:30.590
Hi...

00:15:31.765 --> 00:15:35.326
Azalyn! What...
What are you doing here?!

00:15:35.936 --> 00:15:37.270
Well, I...

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:38.134
Tell me.

00:15:39.906 --> 00:15:42.340
Captain, are you still up?

00:15:45.078 --> 00:15:46.375
Y- Yuriko...

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.539
Captain?

00:15:47.647 --> 00:15:49.410
What can I do for you?

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:54.181
Sorry to bother you, but there's
something we need to discuss.

00:15:54.554 --> 00:15:56.749
Discuss? What, you, too?!

00:15:57.591 --> 00:15:59.525
Oh, forget it. Private joke.

00:15:59.793 --> 00:16:04.253
Oh, great! Is she going to say
she loves Paco-Paco now?!

00:16:05.098 --> 00:16:06.759
You see, what I want to discuss...

00:16:08.335 --> 00:16:11.566
...is the Raalgon empress we're
holding prisoner aboard this ship.

00:16:11.638 --> 00:16:13.230
Goza the 16th.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.066
You mean Azalyn?!

00:16:16.977 --> 00:16:18.968
What? It's about me?

00:16:19.646 --> 00:16:21.910
So, what about Azalyn?

00:16:28.989 --> 00:16:33.926
The Soyokaze will soon be
rejoining the UPSF main fleet.

00:16:34.561 --> 00:16:39.396
The high command will naturally
want us to turn her over to them.

00:16:39.933 --> 00:16:42.163
What do you plan to
do when that happens?

00:16:43.003 --> 00:16:46.063
I want you to tell me honestly
what you think you'll do!

00:16:48.275 --> 00:16:49.606
What would you do, Yuriko?

00:16:50.777 --> 00:16:52.176
I... It's...

00:16:59.352 --> 00:16:59.977
Well?

00:17:01.187 --> 00:17:04.418
I... I don't know...

00:17:04.658 --> 00:17:06.523
Yeah. Neither do I.

00:17:15.535 --> 00:17:20.632
I don't know, but I'm not
handing Azalyn over to them.

00:17:21.675 --> 00:17:22.539
Captain!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.010
Paco-Paco!

00:17:32.552 --> 00:17:35.578
Even you must see that's the
best thing to do, Yuriko.

00:17:36.723 --> 00:17:39.089
Well, yes, but...

00:17:39.726 --> 00:17:41.591
It'll cause all
sorts of trouble...

00:17:42.762 --> 00:17:45.356
You wouldn't have a plan,
would you, Captain?

00:17:45.665 --> 00:17:46.256
Nope.

00:17:53.707 --> 00:17:54.674
Not one.

00:17:58.011 --> 00:17:58.943
Understood, sir.

00:18:01.748 --> 00:18:05.684
Well done, Paco-Paco. I like his
way of doing things the best.

00:18:07.253 --> 00:18:08.584
Good night, Captain.

00:18:08.855 --> 00:18:10.413
Sure. Good night.

00:18:19.065 --> 00:18:22.000
Stop! Stop! Please, stop!

00:18:23.269 --> 00:18:26.397
No good! Then the only
thing left to try is!

00:18:32.612 --> 00:18:35.046
Paco-Paco, what did you just do?

00:18:35.281 --> 00:18:36.475
There's smoke coming out of it.

00:18:54.134 --> 00:18:56.932
Oh, Lieutenant Yamamoto.
What's wrong?

00:18:58.471 --> 00:18:59.733
Lieutenant Yamamoto?

00:19:00.206 --> 00:19:05.610
Well, I've been thinking about
what to do with the empress.

00:19:06.112 --> 00:19:08.603
Now my stomach's started
to ache from it.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:15.110
It's strange... I thought I
knew the right thing to do, but...

00:19:16.356 --> 00:19:17.721
I think that's a good sign.

00:19:25.632 --> 00:19:27.259
What in the world just happened?

00:19:28.935 --> 00:19:29.731
Paco-Paco?

00:19:31.371 --> 00:19:34.135
We're finally alone, Paco-Paco.

00:19:35.508 --> 00:19:37.976
Will you listen to me now?

00:19:38.311 --> 00:19:41.974
You see...
You see, Paco-Paco, I...

00:19:42.515 --> 00:19:43.777
I think that I!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.991
Paco-Paco? Are you asleep?

00:19:55.428 --> 00:19:57.419
But I waited so long...

00:19:58.765 --> 00:20:01.256
Darn it, Paco-Paco! Wake up!

00:20:19.552 --> 00:20:20.917
Oh, Paco-Paco...

00:20:26.826 --> 00:20:30.262
According to our reports,
the destroyer Soyokaze...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.561
...is holding the
Raalgon empress prisoner.

00:20:34.667 --> 00:20:36.760
Our victory is ensured.

00:20:37.237 --> 00:20:40.138
Hold it! Before we discuss
the all-out attack...

00:20:40.206 --> 00:20:43.300
...we should decide on a
punishment for the Soyokaze.

00:20:43.743 --> 00:20:46.211
They went off on
their own against orders!

00:20:46.913 --> 00:20:50.815
And made up for it by
capturing the Raalgon empress!

00:20:50.884 --> 00:20:54.183
We'll just have to
let it slide this time.

00:20:54.254 --> 00:20:57.189
Planning our upcoming operation
is more important now.

00:20:58.191 --> 00:20:59.021
Admiral Mifune.

00:21:00.393 --> 00:21:03.829
Looks like no one's interested
in the Soyokaze now.

00:21:04.898 --> 00:21:07.765
Order the entire
fleet to assemble!

00:21:08.268 --> 00:21:11.863
The UPSF fleet will rendezvous
with the Soyokaze...

00:21:11.938 --> 00:21:15.772
...and then launch an all-out
attack on the Raalgon Empire!

00:22:14.233 --> 00:22:15.257
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.005
It happened one night
with the empress.

00:22:19.005 --> 00:22:21.565
2 x 1 = 2, 2 x 2 = 4,
2 x 3 = 6, 2 x 4 = 8.

00:22:21.808 --> 00:22:24.276
Multiplication? But isn't
that another word for?!!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:26.876
Next time, "Paco-Paco Junior!"
Watch for it.

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:29.045
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:43.463
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:43.463 --> 00:22:46.557
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:47.066 --> 00:22:50.536
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:50.536 --> 00:22:53.369
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:53.873 --> 00:22:56.709
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:56.709 --> 00:23:00.509
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:23:01.314 --> 00:23:03.683
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:03.683 --> 00:23:07.517
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:13.788
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:14.927 --> 00:23:17.263
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:17.263 --> 00:23:20.426
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:20.566 --> 00:23:24.297
Downtown Dance
